<title>USA: Anaconda SD 10, Mont., won by Dain Bosworth.</title>
<headline>Anaconda SD 10, Mont., won by Dain Bosworth.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dain Bosworth Inc. said it won $1.500 million of Anaconda SD 10, Mont., general obligation school building bonds, with a net interest cost of 5.39 percent.</p>
</text>
